Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:38.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and swirl it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:38.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后把它搅成浆糊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.77,0:05:43.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so you're not a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.77,0:05:43.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那好  你不欣赏她的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:46.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, I mean, come on. You cannot do this to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:46.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是你不能这样对她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:52.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no no no no. Oh no no no no.I have to do this to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:52.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不不不  你叫我出面  
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:55.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lather, rinse, repeat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:55.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}涂皂  冲水  再来 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:57.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And lather, rinse, repeat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:57.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}涂皂  冲水  再来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:06:00.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And lather, rinse, repeat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:06:00.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}涂皂  冲水  再来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:02.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As needed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:02.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}洗干净为止
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.61,0:06:11.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I don't think we brought enough stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.61,0:06:11.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得我们东西没有带够
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:13.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you forget to pack the baby's anvil?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:13.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是不是忘带宝宝的止痛贴片了  
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you, it'll be worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我告诉你  这绝对值
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a known fact that women love babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都知道女人最爱宝宝了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Women love guys who love babies. It's the whole sensitive thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女人爱喜欢宝宝的男人  这是感性的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.99,0:06:27.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aim him at that pack of babes. Maybe one of them will break away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.99,0:06:27.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把他对准那边的宝贝们  说不定会过来一个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:31.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. Wait, forget them. We got one. Hard left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:31.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  等一下  她们就算了  正左方来了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:34.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Give me the baby. - No, I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-来  宝宝给我  -不要  我要抱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:35.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:35.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快  我说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:36.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, seriously, you want him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:36.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的要他吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.09,0:06:44.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who is this little cutie-pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.09,0:06:44.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个小可爱是谁啊  
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:46.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, don't think me immodest, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:46.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是我脸皮厚  但真是...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:48.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:48.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.11,0:06:51.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Want to smell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.11,0:06:51.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要不要闻闻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.38,0:06:53.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I assume we're talking about the baby now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.38,0:06:53.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你现在指的是宝宝吧  
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:59.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. He's got that great baby smell. Get a whiff of his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:59.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是呀  他的宝宝味好香  闻闻他的头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:03.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think my uterus just skipped a beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:03.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我的子宫震颤了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:05.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What'd I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:05.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.91,0:07:07.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's great you're doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.91,0:07:07.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们这样带孩子真好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:09.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we are great guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:09.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都是好男人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.73,0:07:13.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My brother and his boyfriend have been trying to adopt for three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.73,0:07:13.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我弟弟跟他的男友试了三年都领养不到孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:15.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What agency did you two go through?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:15.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们是找哪一家机构  
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:21.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But this is my gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:21.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可这是我的驻点场所
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.07,0:07:23.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is where I play.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.07,0:07:23.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我的地盘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:26.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My name is written out there in chalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:26.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的名字用粉笔写在外面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:28.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, you can't just erase chalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:28.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能把粉笔擦掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起  我很遗撼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he's going to be paying this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他居然还要付这个女人酬劳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:39.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why doesn't he just give her a throne and a crown?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:39.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那他干脆给她一个宝座  一顶皇冠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.97,0:07:44.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, like, a gold stick with a ball on top?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.97,0:07:44.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有一根上面有球的权杖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.55,0:07:49.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Terry is a jerk! That's why we always say, "Terry's a jerk!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.55,0:07:49.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}泰利是混蛋  所以我们才常说"泰利是混蛋"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.48,0:07:51.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.48,0:07:51.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的外号就是这么来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.71,0:07:56.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You probably did everything you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.71,0:07:56.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说不定已经尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:01.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. You know what? Let me just see what else I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:01.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我再去试试其它办法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:05.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Look. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听我说  听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:08.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you just let her go on after Stephanie whatever her name is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:08.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要不让她在那个斯蒂芬妮什么的表演完再唱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:11.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You won't be here. You don't pay her.It's not gonna cost you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:11.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你又不在这里  又不付她钱  没什么损失
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:12.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:12.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.77,0:08:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Terry, I'll even clean the cappuccino machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.77,0:08:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托  泰瑞  我帮你洗卡布基诺机好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.00,0:08:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't clean the cappuccino machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.00,0:08:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你平常不洗卡布基诺机吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.78,0:08:21.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course I clean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.78,0:08:21.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然洗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:24.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I will clean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:24.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说我会好好洗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:26.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I will clean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}洗得干干净净
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:29.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, fine, fine, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:29.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  真是拿你没辙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.63,0:08:36.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Done. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.63,0:08:36.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-搞定了 -真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.21,0:08:38.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Who's working for you, babe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.21,0:08:38.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  不看是谁出马了  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:43.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God! This is so exciting! How much am I gonna get?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:43.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  太好了  我能拿多少酬劳  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.20,0:08:44.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.20,0:08:44.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:47.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well you said that he's paying the people who are playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:47.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说他要付钱给演出的人  那...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.07,0:08:51.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, no no. I meant that he's gonna be paying that other woman
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.07,0:08:51.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不不  我是说他要付给另一个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:53.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because she's a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:53.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为她是职业歌手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:56.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not gonna be the only one who's not getting paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:56.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可不想当唯一免费表演的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:09:00.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Well, but Pheebs. - No, huh uh, I'm sorry, no. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:09:00.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可菲比...  -不行  对不起  不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:04.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm not some sloppy second, you know, charity band.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:04.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我可不是什么二流的慈善乐队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:07.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are thousands of places in this city...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:07.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}纽约城里有成千上万个地方  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.45,0:09:09.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where people would pay to hear me play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.45,0:09:09.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}愿意付我出场费
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.20,0:09:12.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I play, I play for me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.20,0:09:12.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为自己而弹唱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't need your charity
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用不着你的施舍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:16.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:16.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.34,0:09:26.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, there's no way I'm gonna get a shot.  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.34,0:09:26.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不要扎针
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:29.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe they can take the needle and squirt it into my mouth. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:29.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们可以把药水打进我的嘴里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:31.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like a squirt gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:31.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像打水枪那样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.19,0:09:34.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello there. I'm Dr. Carlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.19,0:09:34.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好  我是卡林医生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see someone's having a little allergic reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看有人有点过敏反应
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.19,0:09:40.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. Doctor, can I see you for just a minute please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.19,0:09:40.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  医生  我可以单独跟你谈谈吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:47.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My brother has a slight phobia about needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:47.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我哥有点害怕打针
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:49.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you tell him about my squirt gun idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:49.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有没有告诉他我那个打水枪的主意  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.94,0:09:54.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My brother, the Ph.D., would like to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.94,0:09:54.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的博士哥哥想知道  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.56,0:09:56.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...if there's any way to treat this orally?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.56,0:09:56.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个针剂有没有办法口服  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:10:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, under these circumstances it has to be an injection, 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:10:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有  在这种情况之下  打针是难免的 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:02.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and it has to be now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:02.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且要马上打针
